{
  "an5.2:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 5.2 ",
  "an5.2:0.2": "1. Sekhabalavagga ",
  "an5.2:0.3": "Vitthatasutta ",
  "an5.2:1.1": "“Pañcimāni, bhikkhave, sekhabalāni. ",
  "an5.2:1.2": "Katamāni pañca? ",
  "an5.2:1.3": "Saddhābalaṁ, hirībalaṁ, ottappabalaṁ, vīriyabalaṁ, paññābalaṁ. ",
  "an5.2:2.1": "Katamañca, bhikkhave, saddhābalaṁ? ",
  "an5.2:2.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, ariyasāvako saddho hoti, saddahati tathāgatassa bodhiṁ: ",
  "an5.2:2.3": "‘itipi so bhagavā arahaṁ sammāsambuddho vijjācaraṇasampanno sugato lokavidū anuttaro purisadammasārathi satthā devamanussānaṁ buddho bhagavā’ti. ",
  "an5.2:2.4": "Idaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, saddhābalaṁ. ",
  "an5.2:3.1": "Katamañca, bhikkhave, hirībalaṁ? ",
  "an5.2:3.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, ariyasāvako hirīmā hoti, hirīyati kāyaduccaritena vacīduccaritena manoduccaritena, hirīyati pāpakānaṁ akusalānaṁ dhammānaṁ samāpattiyā. ",
  "an5.2:3.3": "Idaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, hirībalaṁ. ",
  "an5.2:4.1": "Katamañca, bhikkhave, ottappabalaṁ? ",
  "an5.2:4.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, ariyasāvako ottappī hoti, ottappati kāyaduccaritena vacīduccaritena manoduccaritena, ottappati pāpakānaṁ akusalānaṁ dhammānaṁ samāpattiyā. ",
  "an5.2:4.3": "Idaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, ottappabalaṁ. ",
  "an5.2:5.1": "Katamañca, bhikkhave, vīriyabalaṁ? ",
  "an5.2:5.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, ariyasāvako āraddhavīriyo viharati akusalānaṁ dhammānaṁ pahānāya, kusalānaṁ dhammānaṁ upasampadāya, t